    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to present this lovely three-bedroom mid-terrace property to the market. One of its standout features is its exceptional location, literally a few steps from  Bailieborough Lough. Bailieborough town centre is also close by, with shops, schools, cafés and a wide range of everyday amenities within easy reach.\r\nThe house has an attractive, low-maintenance faux stone façade and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. On the ground floor, there is a kitchen, a generously sized utility room, guest WC and a comfortable sitting room with a stove. To the rear, a large glazed feature incorporating windows to either side of a central door brings plenty of natural light into the room and provides direct access to the back garden with decking area.\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom.\r\nThis is a well-located and well-presented home in a particularly appealing location, combining proximity to Bailieborough town with the considerable advantage of Bailieborough Lough being on its doorstep. It should appeal to first-time buyers, families and anyone looking for a convenient home in a very pleasant setting."
      },
